components.description:
Array of UI components. Use these types and their props:
- MetricCard: { title, value, subtitle?, unit?, trend?: "up"|"down" }
- ComparisonTable: { title?, headers: string[], rows: (string|number)[][] }
- StatusBadge: { label, status: "info"|"success"|"warning"|"error", description? }
- Timeline: { title?, steps: { label, description?, time?, status?: "completed"|"current"|"upcoming" }[] }
